<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-UBS favour Lloyds - shares up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-UBS favour Lloyds - shares up.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lloyds TSB Group Plc rose on Wednesday amid follow-through buying from yesterday and as analysts at UBS named it as one of their favoured stocks in the sector, dealers said.</p>
<p>In a research note published today, UBS repeated a &quot;hold&quot; recommendation on Lloyds and Abbey National Plc but remained negative on the rest of the sector.</p>
<p>Lloyds shares were up 12p at 494-1/2 by 1025 GMT in volume of 4.1 million shares, after on Tuesday rising 28-1/2p.</p>
</text>
